              <a href={D.cap.cite_url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{D.cap.cite}</a> &mdash;
              the {CAP}-day hold-over cap for seats filled by Mayoral appointment with the advice
              and consent of the Council.
            </dd>
            <dt>Maintained by</dt>
            <dd><b>In Plain Sight</b>, an independent civic steward. This page cites the District&rsquo;s own published register; it does not claim the endorsement of MOTA, the Executive Office of the Mayor, the Council, or any DC agency.</dd>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <div class="aw-provcard">
          <h3>The exact reports read</h3>
          <div class="aw-scroll aw-scroll--bare" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label="Reports read for this page, with row counts and checksums">
          <table class="aw-table aw-table--plain aw-table--tight">
            <caption>Reports read for this page, with the row count and checksum recorded at capture.</caption>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th scope="col">Report</th>
